WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.318
My online English class.

2
00:00:03.768 --> 00:00:05.719
Hello, Lucas! Can you hear me?

3
00:00:06.169 --> 00:00:07.887
Lucas? You're muted!

4
00:00:08.337 --> 00:00:10.148
Oh, sorry! Can you hear me now?

5
00:00:10.598 --> 00:00:11.899
Yes! Perfect.

6
00:00:14.149 --> 00:00:17.631
Today's new word is spoon. Spoon.

7
00:00:18.081 --> 00:00:20.450
I have a question. What does spoon mean?

8
00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:22.479
Spoon means colher.

9
00:00:24.729 --> 00:00:26.076
How do you spell spoon?

10
00:00:26.526 --> 00:00:30.348
S, P, double O, N.

11
00:00:30.798 --> 00:00:32.144
Can you repeat, please?

12
00:00:32.594 --> 00:00:37.531
Of course! S, P, double O, N.

13
00:00:39.781 --> 00:00:42.521
Lucas? Lucas? You're frozen!

14
00:00:42.971 --> 00:00:45.897
Sorry, teacher. My internet connection is slow today.

15
00:00:46.347 --> 00:00:48.483
No problem. See you next class!

16
00:00:48.933 --> 00:00:50.651
Thank you! See you next class!

